s6-2-p3 : Block
s6-2-p3 = prose (cons "The initial `Code` datatype is available during bootstrap, before the checker can certify its own definition. It must therefore be distinguished from the intrinsically checked family \(\mathsf{Code}_{\ell}(\Gamma,A)\) of §6.1. Programs may also define smaller checked syntax datatypes for their particular domains. The specializer below operates on the initial code representation; the result is checked at its declared type before it is admitted as a definition." nil)
